# Cursor rules for Lessons OS

Read docs/CLAUDE.md before making any changes.

## Rules
- Plain HTML + Vanilla JS only. No React, no Vue, no Tailwind.
- All DB operations go in supabase-client.js — never call sb.from() in HTML files
- Never rewrite CSS or the design system unless explicitly asked
- Never rewrite working UI — only touch data layer
- All async calls: try/catch + showToast() for errors
- After changes: verify no alert() calls remain, no broken references

## Design system
CSS variables defined in every HTML file. Use them — never hardcode colors.
Fonts: DM Sans + DM Mono via Google Fonts CDN.
Dark theme: --bg #0f0f11, --surface #18181c, --accent #c8b87a

## File structure
deals.html, workload.html — built
invoicing.html, reporting.html, vendor-portal.html, login.html — to build
supabase-client.js — shared DB client
schema.sql, schema-seed.sql — database setup
docs/ — all markdown context files
